WEBVTT

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:16.550
yume oikakete tatakai tsuzukero

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:19.850
Chase after your dreams and continue the fight
yume oikakete tatakai tsuzukero

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:23.190
ai to yuuki to yuujou
Love, courage, and friendship

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:26.690
kono blade wa ore no bunshin
This Blade is my other self

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.770
chikara no kagiri moero maware
To the limits of my power, spin and be set ablaze

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:32.820
Burning Soul

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:46.250
hitori bocchi ja dekinai
I can't do it all alone

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:50.170
koto mo omae ga ireba yareru
I can do it with you alongside me

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:53.010
kono sekai no hate made mo
Come with me

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:56.350
ore to issho ni ikou
All the way to the end of the world

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:03.580
shi seijuu wa ai no athlete
The four Sacred Beasts are the athletes of love

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:07.150
kagayake me wo samase
They shine as they awake

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:09.790
Dragoon! Dranzer! Draciel! Driger!

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:12.490
yomigaere
Resurrect!

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:16.110
sore kakete koi ore no energy
Take to the skies, my energy!

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:19.450
ima tachiagare seijuu
The time has come to stand up, Sacred Beasts!

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:22.880
subete no teki wo uchitaosu tame
To defeat all our foes

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:26.100
minna no kibou daite kakero
Hold on tight to all our hopes

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:29.100
Shining Soul!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:35.010
Howl, Seiryu! The Birth of Dragoon!

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:37.740
Get ready!

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:38.760
Yeah!

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:41.440
Go...

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:43.430
Shoot!

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:58.780
Kai's Beyblade stays in the center,
but mine spins four times faster.

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:01.200
I'll send it flying using my speed.

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:08.570
What's he doing?

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:13.920
I see!

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:18.080
Kai is trying to take advantage of the air pressure

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:20.080
created by Takao's quadrupled speed!

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:21.570
Hit him!

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:23.720
That's the frustration I was waiting for.

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:30.950
He rose using the air pressure!

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:38.800
That's...

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:45.650
My... Beyblade...

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:48.170
Pathetic.

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:51.430
You lost to such an amateur Beyblade.

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:52.450
Foolish.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:54.970
What?! Amateur?!

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:56.020
Take that back!

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:57.220
Hiruta, we're leaving.

00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:59.370
Stop right there, you jerk!

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:00.000
Takao!

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.360
Don't stop me!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.440
You're a Beyblader!

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:05.610
If you're going to fight, don't use your fists.

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:07.270
Use your Beyblade!

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:13.600
But... I lost my Beyblade.

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:18.260
Even if I want to, I can't!

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:21.600
Damn it!

00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:28.830
This is Takao's house, right?

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:32.750
I wonder if he's still down.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.660
Let's look inside.

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:35.840
Who's there?!

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:40.220
Who are you? Thieves?

00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:43.900
No, you see, we're here to see Takao...

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:47.540
Really? Why didn't you say so right away?

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.840
Takao's in the dojo right now.

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:50.790
Dojo?

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:51.680
Right there.

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:01.420
I can't stay down forever.

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:07.480
I'll will defeat you!

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:26.840
The Ryushinken?

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:30.620
The Ryushinken...

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:34.640
Grandpa says it's our family heirloom with the spirit of a dragon in it.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:39.130
The symbol glowed like this last time too...

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:46.480
Hey, Takao!

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:50.180
Kyoujyu, Akira too!

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.520
I see you're feeling better.

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:56.080
You bet! What'd you expect?

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:58.320
By the way, what are you guys here for?

00:04:58.320 --> 00:04:59.730
Isn't it obvious?

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:00.630
Yes.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:06.520
You learned about the Shell Killers?

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:09.600
We looked into some of their members together.

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:12.480
But we don't know everything yet.

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:14.180
That's fine with me.

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:15.470
Tell me.

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:20.030
The Shell Killers are a group of violent Beybladers.

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:23.460
They cause Bey-related trouble in all kinds of places.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:28.480
It seems that their objective is to find a special Beyblade.

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:33.880
A special Beyblade?
Then, that's what Hiruta was looking for...

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:38.450
But we don't know what kind
of Bey they're searching for.

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:42.610
We only know that they're
willing to do anything to get it.

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:45.650
They don't care how cruel their ways are.

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:48.500
And Kai is their leader.

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:51.200
I see, so he's the boss!

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:53.070
Takao?

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:56.730
Now things are
getting interesting!

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:59.790
Just you wait, Kai of the Shell Killers.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:02.450
I'm gonna beat you!

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:04.100
But, Takao...

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:05.060
What's wrong?

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:08.720
Your Beyblade is broken.
How do you intend to fight them?

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:11.730
Don't worry about that! Follow me.

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:14.750
Look at this.

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:16.890
What's all this?

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.860
I've collected all kinds of parts.

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:21.330
And I've been using them to
make a new Beyblade. Look!

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:24.420
You really think
it's gonna work?

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:27.860
Oh, quiet! Don't judge a book by its cover!

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.660
Yeah, you're right.

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:30.790
This won't do.

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:32.000
What?

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:37.920
If you want to use a Blade Base with this Spin Gear,
you should use a different type of Weight Disk.

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:41.550
You've collected a lot of parts.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:45.920
Good, now what's important is to
put them together in the best way.

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:49.950
Which means the data on Beys
I've collected will be useful.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:53.600
Let's make the best Bey
we can with what we've got!

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:57.230
You're really going to help?

00:06:57.230 --> 00:06:59.250
Get knocked down, and you're right back up!

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.760
I really appreciate that enthusiasm!

00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:03.880
Kyoujyu...

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:04.980
What is it?

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:09.610
You're such a great person!
I'm really happy you want to help me!

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.380
Then let's get to work!

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:14.880
--Yeah!
--Yeah!

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:18.210
My Bey isn't my only friend.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:21.190
I've got Kyoujyu and Akira, too.

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:25.620
With their help, we'll build one heck of a Beyblade!

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:28.070
Just wait and see, Kai!

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:34.300
Kai, I beg of you! Forgive me!

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:37.440
You're one of the Shell Killers' Four Horsemen,

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:39.100
and yet you lost to someone like him.

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:46.020
Stop! Please stop! Stop!!

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:48.170
You're pathetic.

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:53.880
Do it.

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:56.720
Go...

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:57.670
Shoot!

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:12.230
Stop!

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:31.710
You're a nuisance.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.200
Beat it.

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:34.470
Hey...

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:39.280
Any new info about the special Bey?

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:41.980
It isn't direct information,

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:44.770
but I heard something that might interest you.

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:51.500
A semi-famous Beyblade researcher lives in this town.

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:56.200
I hear that they're gathering all
sorts of information about Beys.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:58.060
So that might be the hint we need.

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.490
A researcher, huh...?

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:02.170
I believe he's an elementary schooler.

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:06.020
We've heard that when it comes to Beys,
he's very knowledgeable.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.370
Interesting...

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:16.600
--Ready?
--Yeah!

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:18.540
Go Shoot!

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:23.840
Now, go!

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:30.610
How was that?

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:34.660
I see...

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:37.810
It looked pretty strong, too...

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:41.480
But the power is still below Dranzer's.

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:43.280
You can't win like that.

00:09:44.740 --> 00:09:45.760
Kyoujyu?

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:46.880
Sorry.

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:51.320
I talked a tough game, but this is the best I can do...

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:53.080
That's not true!

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:57.600
This Bey is much faster and stronger than my previous one!

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:59.890
But it still needs to be stronger...

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:03.730
I'll make do with this Bey.

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:05.340
Eh? Takao?

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:09.560
The rest is up to me, the user.

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:15.300
I'll definitely train until I can use this to beat Dranzer!

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:22.340
After all, this Bey is the product of our
teamwork. Especially yours, Kyoujyu.

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:30.410
It's as Takao says! Then let's hurry up and train!

00:10:30.590 --> 00:10:34.870
Yeah, let's get to work!
We'll give Dranzer a hard time!

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:36.260
Right, Akira?

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:39.650
They're certainly optimistic and straight forward people.

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:45.040
But I feel that Dranzer still has hidden capabilities.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:48.600
To defeat it, we need a more powerful Beyblade!

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:52.620
Oh yeah, the data I have at home could help!

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:56.300
Takao, I'm going to run and get something I forgot!

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:58.670
Kyoujyu, thanks!

00:10:58.670 --> 00:10:59.730
It's nothing...

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:14.800
Beyblades! What?!

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:17.680
You're Kyoujyu, right?

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:33.350
Shell Killers!

00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:35.680
What are you doing?!

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:36.720
I'll take this!

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:40.850
--Let go!
--That's...!

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:43.860
I said let me go!

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:46.030
Look, isn't that Kyoujyu?

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:48.180
And he said those were Shell Killers.

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:50.300
--This is bad!
--This is bad!

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:00.240
Just a little more until I get used to it.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.820
That's what using a new one is like.

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:05.450
I feel like I can make it with this one.

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:07.020
I can't wait!

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:08.750
Alright, let's test it again!

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:11.300
--Takao!
--Akira!

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:16.640
What's the rush?

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:17.700
Akira!

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:18.630
Takao...

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:22.150
What?!

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:24.000
Are you for real?

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:26.520
They told him to
give them his data.

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:28.390
Where did they take him?

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.690
To an old warehouse in the outskirts of town!

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:33.910
We followed them, hoping to save him,

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:36.300
but there were too many of them.

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:39.230
Who knows what they'll do to Kyoujyu?!

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:40.980
Darn those Shell Killers!

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:43.420
Wait, Takao! What
are you going to do?

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:47.100
Isn't that obvious?!
I'll save him with force!

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:50.320
They're too many. You don't
stand a chance by yourself!

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:53.290
That's true, but I can't just leave him!

00:12:54.780 --> 00:13:00.100
Akira, didn't you say they were
looking for some kind of Beyblade?

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:01.290
Yes...

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:05.070
In that case, they won't ignore an unknown Beyblade.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:06.410
Are you gonna..?!

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:10.000
I'm going to bet this Beyblade and save Kyoujyu.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.760
But you haven't mastered it yet!

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:14.540
You'll lose again the way it is now.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:16.610
No, it'll get destroyed again!

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:19.270
But I can't leave Kyoujyu...

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:21.530
I can't leave a friend behind!

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:25.450
Your Beyblade might get destroyed again!

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:28.480
I'm sure this one will understand.

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:29.440
Wait!

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:30.640
Don't stop me.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:31.830
That's not it!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:37.220
If you want to enter the wolves' den,
isn't it better to have friends?

00:13:37.220 --> 00:13:39.910
I'm not one to go down in a fight too quickly!

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:42.120
Akira...!

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:44.220
I'll go and get the others! So wait for me!

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:45.390
We'll get some, too!

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:46.260
Yeah!

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:51.030
Those guys are nice after all!

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:52.080
Okay!

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:07.590
Ryushinken...

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:11.150
I'm gonna go save my friend.

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:14.280
The enemy is super strong.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.320
I... might lose.

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:24.950
But I'll fight as hard as I can, just
like my ancestors who made you.

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:26.340
That's why...

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.720
please watch over us, Ryushinken.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:50.370
This is the dragon that I saw in my dream earlier!

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:21.890
What...?

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.410
This Bit....

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:28.080
It feels like power is flowing straight out of it.

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:45.000
All of my data I worked so hard to...

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.210
Is that all of it?

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:47.420
Yes!

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.600
You really don't have any other data?

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:56.280
Anything on a Beyblade with special powers, maybe?

00:15:56.640 --> 00:16:00.490
With special powers?
If I had, I wouldn't give it to you!

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:04.000
You've got quite the mouth on you, don't you?

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:06.310
I'm gonna need to teach you some manners!

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:07.120
Stop!

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:07.810
What?

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:12.080
I'm here for Kyoujyu!

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:13.660
Takao! Akira!

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.720
Don't think we'll let you off the hook for free.

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:19.950
Then I challenge you!

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:22.140
With this Beyblade!

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:26.600
No! Don't sacrifice our new Beyblade to save me!

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:28.740
It's your friend too, isn't it?

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:31.690
You're an important friend too.

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:34.440
Takao!

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:40.470
Skip the formalities. We're taking it by force.

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:43.120
Wait.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:50.030
I'll be his opponent.

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:50.880
But...!

00:16:51.100 --> 00:16:52.120
Got that?

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:53.320
Yes.

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:02.470
Weak Beyblades don't deserve to exist.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:06.390
I will crush your Bey into pieces.

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:09.720
It won't be that easy!

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:12.720
Takao!

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:14.100
Sorry.

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:17.920
It's the first time I use you, and it could be the last.

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:19.290
In exchange...

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:21.450
I'll fight as hard as I can!

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:24.660
Alright, let's go!

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:26.930
Go...

00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:30.210
Shoot!!

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:37.610
The same old straight-on attack!

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.150
Are you begging to be destroyed?

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.410
Go!!

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:43.720
You fool.

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:49.440
This is the end for him.

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:54.090
You can do it!

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:03.290
Incredible! Its fast rotation is
creating a strong whirlwind!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.390
It's a huge tornado!

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:08.320
Even Dranzer can't stand up to that much force!

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.560
I did it!

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:14.600
I may have underestimated you.

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:15.660
But...

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:17.100
I will win!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:24.080
Don't think Dranzer is just any ordinary Bey!

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:33.200
What's that glow?!

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:39.020
Huh? Mine's also glowing!

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:45.530
W-What's happening?

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:03.800
That's not in my data...

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:16.840
What was that dragon?

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:19.520
Dragon? What are you talking about?

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:23.350
You saw it just now, right?! A dragon and a bird appeared from the Bits...

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:26.010
I saw the Bits glowing,

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:28.790
but I didn't see any sort of dragon or bird.

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:31.740
Some people can't see them.

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:33.360
What do you mean?

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:39.480
The Azure Dragon, and the Vermilion Bird
materialized from the power that's inside the bit.

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:43.340
And it's not something
that just anyone can see.

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:45.430
Seiryu? Suzaku?

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:46.720
What's he talking about?

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:50.970
Your Seiryu Bit, and my Suzaku Bit.

00:19:50.970 --> 00:19:53.040
They are not ordinary Bits.

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:57.660
And Beyblades with those
Bits are what I'm searching for.

00:19:57.740 --> 00:20:00.260
Then why are you searching for them?!

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:02.930
You'll know soon enough.

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:05.400
What?! Get back here!

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:09.690
Stand down.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:12.800
You guys won't beat him.

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:15.300
You won this time.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:18.390
Farewell.

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:31.670
Takao.

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:33.880
Thank you.

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:35.520
I'm pleased.

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:36.900
It was nothing!

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:40.230
But we have a lot to investigate now.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.530
The Shell Killers' strange Bit...

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:48.800
Look, I promise I'll beat Kai and the Shell Killers one day.

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:50.820
Together with my new partner.

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:53.380
Speaking of which, what's your Bey called?

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:54.380
A name?

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:55.400
That's right...

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:58.560
If it's your partner, it should at least have a name.

00:20:58.740 --> 00:20:59.920
Right.

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:02.180
Then I'll call it Dragoon.

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:03.470
Dragoon?

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:08.340
Yeah. I'm sure this Bit contains the
spirit of the dragon from the Ryushinken.

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:11.180
Dragoon comes from that dragon.

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:13.550
Yes! It sounds strong, and it's a good name.

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:16.730
I'll be counting on you from here on,

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:18.050
Dragoon.

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:24.830
Seiryu's symbol is gone!

00:21:25.890 --> 00:21:27.030
Did...

00:21:27.030 --> 00:21:29.530
Takao see the dragon?

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:44.780
haru wa te wo furi hohoende
Spring smiles when meeting again

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:50.240
natsu wa jounetsu wo furimaite
Summer is sprinkled with passion

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:55.420
kisetsu wa utsurikawatte
The seasons change

00:21:55.420 --> 00:21:59.610
aki wa fuyu ga tomodachi
and Autumn is friends with Winter

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:05.720
kaiketsu dekinai koto tte
There are some things you can't solve

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:11.580
shinrai yuujou aijou kanjou
Like trust, friendship, love, and feelings

00:22:14.150 --> 00:22:18.850
donna toki demo kumo wa nagareteru
No matter when, the clouds will continue to flow

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:24.230
itsudatte onaji sora wa nai
No two skies are alike

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:29.140
ruisen takamatte ochiru shizuku datte
Just because drops of water are welling up in my eyes

00:22:29.140 --> 00:22:33.140
kanashii wake dake janai
doesn't mean I'm sad

00:22:34.870 --> 00:22:39.470
yuuki wo dashite kotoba ni shitemiru
I'll drum up my courage and try to put it in words

00:22:39.470 --> 00:22:44.840
saa tabidatou kibou no machi e
"C'mon, let's take a journey to the city of hopes"

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:49.800
yakusoku datte kanarazu kanau sa
I always keep my promises

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:54.480
(It's) gonna be a clear day

00:22:57.360 --> 00:23:02.160
According to my calculations, that
Shooter is called an "EZ Grip Shooter".

00:23:02.160 --> 00:23:06.440
And that incredibly stable and swift Beyblade's part is called Protoshell.

00:23:06.880 --> 00:23:12.950
The Beyblader who combined those together into a calculated shoot is the prodigy, Max!

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:16.260
More rivals are on the scene!

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:20.660
Next Time!
"A New Friend, His Name is Max"

00:23:20.660 --> 00:23:24.980
Takao's weakness has been exposed!
A New Friend, His Name is Max
